{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"06b29833d66a321e45133f193d6d9da4e9fa762d9c34755bd2af004ec221f954","digest":{"component_or_area":"autodeploy review gate","key_entities":["DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX","AUTODEPLOY_REVIEW_INTERRUPT","REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","DEFAULT_REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_review_drain.py","infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf","test_defer_bound_default_outlasts_the_apps_own_per_review_cap","DEFER_BOUND_REVIEW_CAP_MULTIPLE"],"problem_keywords":["autodeploy deferral bound","review interrupt","bound exceeded","LLM-Review gate","deferral timeout"],"propositions":["On 2026-08-12, four AUTODEPLOY_REVIEW_INTERRUPT / bound-exceeded firings overshot the 1800s DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX bound by 10s, 20s, 10s, and 130s, killing in-flight LLM-Review operations.","The current 1800s bound is sized at 1.5x REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS (1200s) and is marginally too small to absorb burst-mode deferral variance.","Raising DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX to 2400s (2.0x REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS) clears the worst observed overshoot by 470s, absorbing all four Aug-12 firings.","The bound must remain tied to a fixed multiple of the app's per-review timeout cap (not a free-floating literal) to self-adjust when REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS changes.","The test assertion must be tightened from bound >= 1.0x to bound >= 2.0x REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS to enforce the relationship rather than comment it."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1786581489249072026,"uuid":"49660676-865c-4083-b54d-18a6f8e063f7"}